-- CAPABILITY -------- errors/role_grant_exceeded_2.march

Role `Stream.Cons` is granted `IO.NetConnect` (`role Cons needs IO.NetConnect`), but the body passed to `Stream_Run.run_Cons` reaches `IO.FileWrite` (reached from the body: body → wipe). A role's grant bounds everything its code reaches, as `main`'s grant bounds the program. [role_grant_exceeded]
help: add `IO.FileWrite` to the grant in protocol `Stream`: `role Cons needs IO.NetConnect, IO.FileWrite`. Or remove the use.

39 |     let _ = Stream_Run.run_Cons("cons", "secret", Stream_Run.addrs_from_env(), body)
                                                                                    ^^^^

    run `march --explain role_grant_exceeded`


